OL,3,GNEWSADiwali hampers to bring hope to
OL,4,Afamilies in need
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of volunteers have packed food
OL,7,Fparcels to distribute to people across
OL,8,FBirmingham struggling with the rising
OL,9,Fcost of living.
OL,11,FAbout 300 people turned up to the
OL,12,FDiwali Basket Brigade event at the RSRS
OL,13,FCentre in Hockley, which was organised
OL,14,Fby The Diwali Foundation.
OL,16,FIt is the ninth time the charity has
OL,17,Fbrought community volunteers from a
OL,18,Fvariety of backgrounds together to make
OL,19,Fhampers in the build up to the
OL,20,Freligious festival.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
