OL,3,GNEWSADiwali hampers to bring hope to
OL,4,Afamilies in need
OL,5,
OL,6,FDeepak Parekh, founder of the
OL,7,Finitiative, said: "[The] cost of living
OL,8,Fcrisis hasn't gone away... but Diwali
OL,9,Fis a celebration of light over
OL,10,Fdarkness, and this is our little way of
OL,11,Fbringing some light and some hope into
OL,12,Fthe families that need it most."
